---
import { events, poster } from "../data/events";
---

<section id="v-evento" class="view" data-view="evento">
  {events.map((e, i) => (<template data-poster={e.id} set:html={poster(e, 200 + i)} />))}
  <script type="application/json" id="events-json" set:html={JSON.stringify(events)} />

  <div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden px-5 pb-16 pt-32">
    <div id="ev-bg" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 scale-125 opacity-40 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-bg/30 to-bg"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
      <a href="#/eventos" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-mute hover:text-white">← Volver a eventos</a>
      <div class="mt-6 grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
        <div class="poster-wrap tilt aspect-[4/5] max-w-md" id="ev-poster" data-tilt><div class="poster absolute inset-0" id="ev-art"></div><div class="glare"></div></div>
        <div>
          <p id="ev-art-name" class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-lime"></p>
          <h1 id="ev-title" class="mt-3 text-[clamp(2.4rem,7vw,6rem)] font-bold uppercase leading-[0.95]"></h1>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
            <span class="glass rounded-full px-4 py-2">📅 <b id="ev-date"></b></span><span class="glass rounded-full px-4 py-2">🕒 <b id="ev-time"></b></span><span class="glass rounded-full px-4 py-2">📍 <b id="ev-venue"></b></span>
          </div>
          <p id="ev-desc" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75"></p>
          <div class="mt-8" aria-label="Cuenta atrás"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-mute">Empieza en</p>
            <div class="flex gap-3" id="cd-box">{["Días", "Horas", "Min", "Seg"].map((l) => (<div class="glass min-w-[4.5rem] rounded-2xl px-3 py-3 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tabular-nums" data-cd>00</p><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-mute">{l}</p></div>))}</div></div>
          <p id="ev-left" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-lime/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-lime"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]">
    <div class="glass min-w-0 rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-10">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Elige tus asientos</h2>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-xs text-mute"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-white/70"></i>Libre</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-lime"></i>Tuyo</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#2a2a3d]"></i>Ocupado</span></div></div>
      <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto"><svg id="seatmap" viewBox="0 0 640 400" class="mx-auto min-w-[560px] max-w-full" role="group" aria-label="Mapa de asientos"></svg></div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-center text-xs text-mute">Toca los asientos para seleccionarlos. Máximo 6 por compra.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start">
      <div class="glass relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-8" id="buybox">
        <div class="aurora -right-10 -top-10 h-48 w-48 bg-violet/60"></div>
        <p class="relative text-sm text-mute">Tu selección</p>
        <ul id="sel-list" class="relative mt-3 min-h-[3rem] space-y-2 text-sm"></ul>
        <div class="relative mt-6 space-y-2 border-t border-line pt-5 text-sm">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-mute"><span>Entradas</span><span id="sum-base">0 €</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-mute"><span>Gastos de gestión</span><span id="sum-fee">0 €</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-end justify-between pt-2"><span class="font-semibold">Total</span><span class="font-display text-4xl font-bold"><span id="sum-total">0</span><span class="text-lime">€</span></span></div>
        </div>
        <button id="buy" class="btn btn-lime relative mt-6 w-full !py-4 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40" disabled data-magnetic>Comprar entradas</button>
        <ul class="relative mt-5 space-y-2 text-xs text-mute"><li>🔒 Pago protegido hasta que entras</li><li>⚡ Entrega inmediata con QR</li><li>↩️ Devolución si algo falla</li></ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-28 max-w-7xl px-5">
    <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem)] font-bold uppercase leading-none">También te puede <span class="text-outline">gustar</span></h2>
    <div id="related" class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"></div>
  </div>
</section>
